						 <p>Thanks a lot, jerk. I read this about 30 minutes before putting my girls to bed. Now, for reference, I did not read it to them, nor did I make any references to this story while putting them to bed. My oldest starts her nightly routine of complaining about monsters in the room. Nothing new, right? Until I ask where the monsters are. &quot;The monsters are blankets, daddy.&quot; Well done.</p> 
