					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I used to sleep downstairs, but the heating and A/C don't reach it so well, so I migrated to the top floor of the house.</p> <p>Sometimes I wake up and think I'm still in the basement and start pounding on the wall where my door would be and panicking until someone comes to rescue me. :P</p> 
				 	]]>
