					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472753#post-1466955</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472753/monsters#post-1466955</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 Jun 2012 06:39:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Sinister</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1359408</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That's pretty cool.<br /> When I was little, I had a nightmare where I couldn't get out of my bed because there were invisible walls, and it was actually bordering on reality and left me panicking while awake thinking I still couldn't get out.<br /> It was really weird.</p> 
				 	]]>
