					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472753#post-1466954</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472753/monsters#post-1466954</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 Jun 2012 06:38:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Etherealize</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1325273</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This stemmed from something that actually happened to me :P</p> <p>No, I wasn't attacked. I woke up from some nightmare, and my still mostly asleep and adrenaline filled brain told me to run, so I tried. Got tangled up in the blankets, fell, and my brain screamed &quot;Something's holding onto you!&quot;</p> <p>So the next morning I woke up, felt incredibly stupid, and then wrote this thing up.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
